# Muller-Plathe reverse-NEMD kappa for biaxially strained Si1-xGex
# (P3 pivot, issue 55, 2026-09-29). Same Tersoff-1989 SiCGe.tersoff file
# and the same MP protocol as phase_c/production/in.mp_kappa2, plus a
# biaxial strain eps applied relative to the unstrained box AT THE RUN
# TEMPERATURE (so eps is purely mechanical, thermal expansion excluded).
# Heat always flows along z (the long box axis). Two geometries:
#   dir = 0 (cross-plane): film normal = z; x,y held at (1+eps)*a(T), z free
#   dir = 1 (in-plane):    film normal = y; x,z held at (1+eps)*a(T), y free
# which is a pseudomorphic film on a substrate whose lattice is
# (1+eps) times the alloy's own, e.g. SiGe on Si(001) has eps ~ -0.042 x.
# Variables: -var x -var T -var eps -var dir -var ncz -var seed
#            -var ncxy -var swapn -var pot -var out
variable x     index 0.5
variable T     index 300
variable eps   index 0.0
variable dir   index 0
variable ncz   index 48
variable seed  index 20260929
variable ncxy  index 4
variable swapn index 50
variable pot   index SiCGe.tersoff
variable out   index mp_out

units metal
boundary p p p
variable a0 equal 5.431+(5.658-5.431)*v_x
lattice diamond ${a0}
lattice diamond 5.4537
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5.4537 5.4537 5.4537
region box block 0 ${ncxy} 0 ${ncxy} 0 ${ncz}
region box block 0 4 0 ${ncxy} 0 ${ncz}
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 ${ncz}
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 48
create_box 2 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.8148 21.8148 261.7776)
  1 by 1 by 16 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 6144 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.8148 21.8148 261.7776)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds
if "${x} > 0" then "set type 1 type/fraction 2 ${x} ${seed}"
set type 1 type/fraction 2 ${x} ${seed}
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.1 ${seed}
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.1 29100
Setting atom values ...
  618 settings made for type/fraction
mass 1 28.0855
mass 2 72.63
pair_style tersoff
pair_coeff * * ${pot} Si(D) Ge
pair_coeff * * /uufs/chpc.utah.edu/sys/installdir/r8/lammps/08022023.3/share/lammps/potentials/SiCGe.tersoff Si(D) Ge
Reading tersoff potential file /uufs/chpc.utah.edu/sys/installdir/r8/lammps/08022023.3/share/lammps/potentials/SiCGe.tersoff with DATE: 2009-03-18
timestep 0.001
thermo 10000
velocity all create $(2*v_T) ${seed} dist gaussian
velocity all create 600 ${seed} dist gaussian
velocity all create 600 29100 dist gaussian

# 1) unstrained box at T: NPT aniso, then average the box
fix npt all npt temp ${T} ${T} 0.1 aniso 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix npt all npt temp 300 ${T} 0.1 aniso 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix npt all npt temp 300 300 0.1 aniso 0.0 0.0 1.0
run 30000
